{"seq":2,"slug":"nodejs-and-npm","title":"Node.js & npm","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":6,"docCount":19,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.59,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"node-js-npm-简介\">Node.js &amp; npm 简介</h1><p>Node.js 彻底改变了 JavaScript 的定位——它不再仅仅是一门浏览器脚本语言，而是成为了覆盖前端、后端、CLI 工具、桌面应用乃至物联网的全栈平台。npm（Node Package Manager）作为世界上最大的开源软件注册中心，构建了一个无与伦比的包生态系统，让开发者能够以极高的效率复用和共享代码。无论你是前端工程师希望理解构建工具的底层原理，还是后端开发者选择 Node.js 作为服务端技术栈，亦或是全栈工程师需要统一前后端技术选型，这本手册都将为你提供系统而深入的知识体系。</p>\n<p>本手册面向已经具备 JavaScript 基础的开发者。如果你熟悉 ES6+ 语法、理解基本的异步概念，那么你已经具备了深入学习 Node.js 的前提条件。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>运行时基础</strong>从 Node.js 的架构设计出发，深入剖析事件循环机制、V8 引擎与 libuv 的协作原理，以及 CommonJS 与 ESM 两大模块系统的设计哲学与实践差异。理解运行时的底层机制是编写高性能 Node.js 代码的基石。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>异步编程</strong>是 Node.js 最核心的编程范式。从回调函数到 Promise，从 async/await 的语法糖到 Stream 流式处理与 Buffer 二进制操作——掌握这些异步模式将决定你能否写出高效、可维护的 Node.js 应用。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>包管理</strong>深入 npm 生态系统的方方面面。从 package.json 的每一个字段含义，到 pnpm 的内容寻址存储与 monorepo 工作空间管理，再到版本策略与包发布流程——包管理是现代 JavaScript 工程化的核心环节。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>核心 API</strong> 覆盖 Node.js 最常用的内置模块。文件系统操作、路径处理、操作系统信息获取、子进程管理、Worker 线程并行计算、HTTP 服务器与 TCP 网络编程——这些是构建任何 Node.js 应用的基础积木。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>后端框架</strong>探讨主流的 Node.js Web 框架。从经典的 Express 和 Koa，到新兴的 Hono 等现代框架，以及贯穿所有框架的中间件模式——帮助你在实际项目中做出明智的框架选型。</p>\n<p>第六章<strong>工具链与生态</strong>关注开发效率和代码质量。调试与性能分析工具、Vitest 和 Jest 的测试实践、安全最佳实践——一个成熟的 Node.js 项目不仅要功能正确，更要可调试、可测试、可信赖。</p>\n<p>Node.js 的单线程事件驱动模型看似简单，实则蕴含着精妙的设计智慧。本手册的目标是帮助你真正理解这些设计背后的 &quot;为什么&quot;，从而在面对复杂的工程问题时，能够做出基于原理而非经验的技术决策。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"runtime-fundamentals","title":"运行时基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/runtime-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"node-architecture-and-event-loop","title":"Node.js 架构与事件循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/runtime-fundamentals/node-architecture-and-event-loop"},{"seq":2,"slug":"v8-engine-and-libuv","title":"V8 引擎与 libuv","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/runtime-fundamentals/v8-engine-and-libuv"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modules-commonjs-and-esm","title":"模块系统：CommonJS 与 ESM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/runtime-fundamentals/modules-commonjs-and-esm"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"async-programming","title":"异步编程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/async-programming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"callbacks-and-promises","title":"回调与 Promise","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/async-programming/callbacks-and-promises"},{"seq":2,"slug":"async-await-patterns","title":"Async/Await 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/async-programming/async-await-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"streams-and-buffers","title":"Stream 与 Buffer","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/async-programming/streams-and-buffers"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"package-management","title":"包管理","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"npm-ecosystem","title":"npm 生态系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/npm-ecosystem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"package-json-in-depth","title":"深入 package.json","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/package-json-in-depth"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pnpm-and-monorepos","title":"pnpm 与 Monorepo","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/pnpm-and-monorepos"},{"seq":4,"slug":"version-management-and-publishing","title":"版本管理与发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/version-management-and-publishing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"core-apis","title":"核心 API","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/core-apis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fs-path-and-os","title":"fs、path 与 os","url":"/l-doc-books/